  "notes": "selfoss RSS reader. Distinctive: near-black sidebar with a teal vertical edge rule, teal 'Mark as read' button, Unread count in a red cloud pill, tiny subscript counts after Newest/Starred, per-tag colour squares. Main list sits on a faint diagonal hatch pattern; each row has a left grey/teal rule, favicon square, title, saturated coloured tag chips (4px radius) and a grey 11px meta line joined by bullets. Read items fade to grey text. Clicking an item expands it in place to a bordered box with multi-column article text and a grey bottom toolbar (Star, Mark as read, Open, Twitter/Facebook/Pocket/Diaspora/email share). Many duplicate stories from two Meridian feeds."
